Refactored the SKU matching logic in server/api.php based on new user requirements.
Removed all functionality related to creating new products for unmatched SKUs. The application now only performs a SELECT operation to find existing items.
Removed transaction handling (begin_transaction, commit, rollback) as it is no longer necessary for read-only operations.
Simplified the response mechanism. The API now always returns a 200 OK status with success: true, providing a matchedSkus array containing the items that were found. Unmatched SKUs are ignored.
If the supplier TIN is not found, the API now returns an empty matchedSkus array instead of an error, making the behavior more consistent.